e different types of enemies, learn about their traits and weaknesses, and try to break through your opponent's defenses. Over time, enemies will become stronger and more cunning, challenging the limits of your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139380/extras/59134a9cc3af418b21db53436b301d4f.poster.avif?t=1754182274\" width=616 height=217 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139380/extras/59134a9cc3af418b21db53436b301d4f.webm?t=1754182274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Strategy meets Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your villagers alive by building farms and managing resources.\u00a0 They clean trash and man your turrets.\u00a0 Can you survive and top the leaderboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139380/extras/05d105a2c3b5afc37e89d6bdbe06eb8b.poster.avif?t=1754182274\" width=616 height=217 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139380/extras/05d105a2c3b5afc37e89d6bdbe06eb8b.webm?t=1754182274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
